{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "15edd9d7-593b-8288-be32-90bd8c24f5c0",
  "created_at": "2026-03-13T13:36:55-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:35:24-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:35:27-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise. Esteban Rivera. Don't worry, nobody's bleeding, it's just paint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:35:32-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paint, okay. I can work with paint. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:35:36-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The crosswalk paint's faded to almost nothing. Cars just don't stop. They fly right through, you can't even see the lines anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:35:44-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens, especially after the winter. Where is the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:35:49-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "131 Bridge Street, in the Point. And it's right in the bike lane too, so it's not only people walking. Bikes come through there and the cars don't slow down for anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:01-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 131 Bridge Street, faded crosswalk at the bike lane. I'll put that in as a request for the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:09-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. How long does something like that usually take? Weeks, months?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:14-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it depends. Striping is mostly weather-dependent, so they usually wait for it to warm up and then work through a list. Could be a few weeks, could be longer if it's a busy spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:27-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's about what I figured. Sorry for the quick call, I'm a stock clerk and I've got a lull between deliveries, so I'm grabbing the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:37-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, this is perfect. Do you want a callback number on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:43-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:45-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0177. All set, Mr. Rivera. I'll get it logged right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:50-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:36:52-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
